# Actual successor publication review plan — no future approval

This is a read-only preparation for the coordinator's eventual native generation
and inspection at the applied source-successor endpoint. There is no regenerated
selection to approve here. Do not infer future row counts or dispositions from
the earlier TC candidate. The coordinator owns the running source prepare and
all future application/generation/inspection invocations.

## Bind the actual endpoint first

After native source application is verified, the coordinator generates through
the selected Claw `f604127114146320f5a92529cc62f190d0a0c25f` producer and obtains
the native publication inspection. Its exact request, generation receipt,
selection, full current owners, canonical beforeimages, ID ledgers, mapping
semantics and complete curation-successor closure become new review inputs.
Do not transplant a TC selection digest, report source HEAD, owner hash or old
row position into that review. Match historical facts by permanent owner plus
predicate/object and exact before-row content; positions are historical locators.

The copied sodium-stock diagnostic proposal is separately documented in
`RETIREMENT-ADAPTATION-HANDOFF.json`. Independent readback must precede use.
Its scope remains diagnostic omission only. It does not authorize canonical
removal, owner curation, supported export or disposal of history.

## Reusable evidence and its limits

- The original TC mapping-review and mapping-evidence files preserve explicit
  complete-row SUPPORTED/WITHHOLD reasons, original source assertions and their
  review lineage. They are historical decisions, not a new release verdict.
- Original record-review text in the historical-review archive remains
  `prior_review`. A previous LLM assessment must never be relabeled a primary
  authority. A positive prior assessment is usable only at its documented scope
  when the actual current material/claim remains the same.
- Captured ChEBI v255 statements, other local ontology declarations, official
  MeSH2026 triples, PubChem/NLM responses, manufacturer captures and original
  source-row payloads remain reusable facts when their hashes and actual claim
  scope match. An ontology's definition or structure proves the target's meaning,
  not the identity of an ambiguous source material.
- The earlier per-row proposal packet is a scientific work product against a
  known-defective TC candidate. It supplies prior reasoning and explicit limits,
  not native installation approval. Its old positive Apidaecin interpretation is
  superseded by the confirmed #1377 subtype finding and correction.
- Metadata-only stable subject spelling, date, producer provenance or cleared
  old validation stamps does not by itself require new literature. Still inspect
  every actual changed cell and affirm what the metadata means. A date is not a
  new literature-review date; confidence grades are not measured probabilities.
- If owner chemistry, supplied form, label scope, predicate/object, any emitted
  synonym or active evidence has changed, reassess that complete current row and
  its negative evidence. Do not blanket-transfer or blanket-withdraw support.

